{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"If you are in this channel, you are trusted by Trapero and their network of smugglers across Empire city. They perform various duties for the rebellion, though their most common is running supplies to General Washington and his associates. Due to Trapero's similarly colored skin and hair to the general, they also often end up working as a decoy for Washington. It is my goal that eventually every player will be a part of this channel, but it will remain private for a while as player membership grows. You are free to discuss rebellion plans here, though you are not to discuss any plans made here with those not in this channel and must be careful when doing so with members who are in this channel. You may travel to and from this location via <#862869435940339732> or <#862869528059576360>.","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:23:41.932000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T07:24:25.525000Z","id":"867305822857723924","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"One may only gain access to the <@&867302089901604894> role by being approved by Prosser or Trapero at this point. If you are a member, you may recommend future recruits to Trapero (by pinging me with the character's name), who will then begin scouting and eventually invite them to a meeting, where should they be approved they will be given the <@&867302089901604894> role and allowed into this channel. Inviting comrades is important, as it will allow them access to more potential invitational/mini event opportunities.","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:31:33.657000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867307801416433665","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
