{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"Finn looks around for any others like Trapero or Prosser but settles with leaving a note\n\n```The following names will be a great addition to this group, I can trust them with my lives and I know they already fight for the cause or have experience smuggling. \n\n- Nolan Reeves\n- Apgan\n- Eliza\n- Ed Harkness\n- Willow\n- Eldon/The Watcher/Phoenix\n- Fuddles\n- Sonny Cairn\n- Irinx ```","created_at":"2021-07-22T19:54:33.044000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867857168783114280","reply_to_id":"867308076243746836","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"```diff\nAdditionally I already have stockpiled weapons, ammunition, food, armor, patriotic clothing, flags, and other adventuring gear that I have worked on sharing. Let me know if you need anything in particular.\n\nI have met and am working on a deal with an arms manufacturer that can make working guns out of wooden materials. Will come back with more details later.\n\nNews that needs to get to General Washington: One of his top security advisors is leaking information and has betrayed his forces to the British. \n\nMy request for you:\nI need information and a location of the Ex Shadow Lamplighter Buchanan. They betrayed us and allowed redcoats to enter the city through the Noir and through hampstead's Gazette. \n\nThere is also a figure named Captain Birch that has taken and killed anyone asking too many questions. I'm investigating a way to find them and stop them, I plan to infiltrate on Tuesday morning but must find an alternate entrance.```","created_at":"2021-07-22T19:59:33.976000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-22T20:12:16.389000Z","id":"867858430983274536","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
